# limit of Y₁ as x->A.  N: 0 both sides, 1 right only, -1 left only
# out C,L (as BCLIM1) and ʟLS={C right,L right,C left,L left}
0→M
{4,0,4,0}→ʟLS
If N≥0
Then
1→D
prgmBCLIM1
C→ʟLS(1)
L→ʟLS(2)
End
If N≤0
Then
⁻1→D
prgmBCLIM1
C→ʟLS(3)
L→ʟLS(4)
End
If N=0
Then
2→C
ʟLS(2)→L
If ʟLS(1)=0 and ʟLS(3)=0 and abs(ʟLS(2)-ʟLS(4))≤1ᴇ⁻3*(1+abs(ʟLS(2)))
0→C
If ʟLS(1)=ʟLS(3) and abs(ʟLS(1))=1
ʟLS(1)→C
If ʟLS(1)=4 or ʟLS(3)=4
4→C
End
